{%- case field -%}
{%- when 'group' -%}wellness
{%- when 'wellness' -%}
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Who is it for? <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.who_is_it_for != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.who_is_it_for | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Someone with premature greying of hair<br> Someone who has very dry &amp; brittle hair<br> If your hair has been damaged by chemical/colour treatments<br> Someone with limp, lifeless hair</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Ingredients <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.ingredients != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.ingredients | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Hibiscus leaves &amp; petals, Roses, Curry leaves, Virgin Coconut oil, Sesame oil, Castor seed oil, Carom seed extract, Fenugreek seed extract, Basil, Neem, kalonji</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>What is it? <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.what_is_it != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.what_is_it | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Infused with the best ingredients for greying hair, hibiscus oil can repair hair that is damaged due to chemical treatments. It is great for scalp health and restores shine, softness and vitalty to the hair. It is infused for hours in brass vessels, thus retaining the best nutritional properties of the ingredients</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>What makes it different <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.why_it_is_unique != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.why_it_is_unique | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Many people have been complaining of premature greying and the solution is not to keep hiding the greys but interally healing the hair. Hibiscus has been used since ancient times in India and this hair oil champions this ingredient.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Disclaimer <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.disclaimer != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.disclaimer | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p>A patch test is mandatory. If the product or a natural ingredient irritates your skin, please stop using it immediately. Please consult your naturopath or physician before using these products.</p>{% endif %}</div></details>
{%- endcase -%}
